    "title": "Fresh chat sessions land on a stable route",
    "intro": "Today's nightly is a focused fix for the chat app's \"fresh chat\" flow: new conversations now bind to their session correctly, swap the temporary fresh URL for the canonical session route once the backend catches up, and share links pick up the right project and instance from the URL.",
    "entries": [
